{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a <strong>scavenger</strong> in a <strong>post-apocalypse</strong>. With a companion, you explore an <strong>abandoned building complex</strong> in search of a rare resource, <strong>Ordostones</strong>. Be aware that <strong>you are not alone</strong>, as something that brought humanity's world to desolation <strong>stalks you within the fog</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661380/extras/Screenshot__40_.png?t=1745601033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All you have is a <i>map, night vision, and your companion</i> in a world where <strong>something lurks\u00a0</strong>to prey on you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be quick.</strong> <strong>Find the stones.</strong> <strong>And get out of there.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661380/extras/Screenshot__23_.png?t=1745601033\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Krysolov</strong> is an <strong>atmospheric</strong> first-person horror experience in a <strong>post-apocalyptic</strong> future.\u00a0\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661380?t=1745601033","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661380?t=1745601033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661380/27f3bc5b2d582989900b881b367278465d203e4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745601033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661380/27f3bc5b2d582989900b881b367278465d203e4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745601033","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains mild violence without explicit imagery and conce